# Globe transport view only

These conventions apply **only** to Globe Word Map (`globe-view.js` principality transport view). Do **not** change explore, constellation, or force-graph link behavior in `app.js` unless explicitly requested.

## Principality topic shire

- Topics appear as settlement/house icons on a parchment regional map.
- **No inter-topic connector lines** — sharing the same principality map implies they are related.
- All topics use the same house icon treatment (no callout bubbles or special sensitive styling).

## Fruit / root layers

- Fruit metro (banners + walled ring), root metro line, drag-to-spin — globe transport only.
- Single-fruit principalities: top-center banner + smaller globe.

## When editing other views

- Preserve `buildVisibleGraph()`, `edges`, and layer toggles in `app.js` for explore/constellation.
- Do not remove topic–root, topic–fruit, or topic–principality links from non-globe views based on globe transport rules.
